@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam maxMessageSize 260
skinparam ParticipantPadding 24
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #42566B
  LifeLineBorderColor #8295A8
  LifeLineBackgroundColor #D8EAFE
  ActivationBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBorderColor #42566B
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  ParticipantFontColor #172B4D
  ActorBorderColor #42566B
  ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  GroupBorderColor #8295A8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F4F7FA
  GroupHeaderFontColor #172B4D
  DividerBackgroundColor #E8F1FA
  DividerBorderColor #8295A8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFBEB
  BorderColor #BBA86A
  FontSize 12
}
hide footbox
title UC-P05 - Cancel a Charging Request
actor Student as ST
boundary "Student Portal" as UI
control "Charging Request Service" as SVC
entity "Mobility Records" as DATA

note over ST,DATA
  Preconditions: Student is signed in and has a charging-request reference.
  Service calls use the signed-in Student's identity.
end note

ST -> UI: Cancel charging request
activate UI #D8EAFE
UI -> SVC: Get cancellation summary (requestRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> DATA: Load owned request, charging allocation and parking status (studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Current states, allocations and summary version / unavailable / retrieval error
deactivate DATA
opt owned record retrieved and not already Cancelled
SVC -> SVC: Check status is Pending or Scheduled
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Cancellable / ineligible
deactivate SVC
end
SVC --> UI: Cancellation context, existing result or explicit error
deactivate SVC
alt record missing, inaccessible or retrieval failed
UI --> ST: Generic unavailable record / read error; return to bookings or retry
else already Cancelled
UI --> ST: Show existing cancellation; do not release resources again
else owned record exists but is not cancellable
UI --> ST: Reject request cancellation; Active charging needs its interruption procedure
else eligible for cancellation
UI --> ST: Review assigned slot (if any); parking will remain unchanged
end
deactivate UI
break record unavailable, read failed, already Cancelled or not cancellable
note over ST,DATA
  End this attempt; no new cancellation or resource release.
end note
end
note over ST,DATA
  Pending without an allocation: cancellation does not change charging-point capacity.
end note
ST -> UI: Confirm or decline cancellation
activate UI #D8EAFE
alt Student declines, edits or abandons
UI --> ST: Leave all records and allocations unchanged
else Student confirms
UI -> SVC: Confirm cancellation (requestRef, summaryVersion, operationRef)
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC -> SVC: Recheck session and permission
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: Current access result
deactivate SVC
alt session expired or permission denied
SVC -> SVC: Prepare authentication-required / access-denied result
activate SVC #D8EEDC
SVC --> SVC: No update attempted
deactivate SVC
else session valid and permission granted
critical Recheck charging request and cancel its allocation
SVC -> DATA: Cancel owned Pending/Scheduled request only if\ncurrent allocation matches confirmed summary
activate DATA #E2E7ED
note over SVC,DATA
  Mark Cancelled and release any future charging allocation once.
  Pending without allocation does not change capacity. Already Cancelled returns existing result.
  Never update the associated parking booking or session.
end note
DATA --> SVC: Cancelled / already cancelled / summary changed / ineligible / save failure
deactivate DATA
end
opt update outcome uncertain / response lost
SVC -> DATA: Find original charging cancellation result (operationRef, studentId)
activate DATA #E2E7ED
DATA --> SVC: Original result / still unknown
deactivate DATA
end
end
SVC --> UI: Operation outcome and accessible current details
deactivate SVC
alt access invalid
UI --> ST: Sign in if permitted; reload current records and confirm again
else outcome still unknown
UI --> ST: Outcome unconfirmed; retain operationRef and resolve original result before retry
else save failed
UI --> ST: Report failure; no partial update; retry after reload and revalidation
else summary changed but records remain cancellable
UI --> ST: No cancellation; reload updated consequences and ask for confirmation again
else record or dependent became ineligible
UI --> ST: Reject request cancellation for Active/Completed/Interrupted; show current status
else cancelled or already cancelled
UI --> ST: Show Cancelled request and unchanged parking status; no duplicate release
end
end
deactivate UI

legend bottom left
  Thin rectangle: execution of a responsibility; nested rectangle: nested execution
  Solid arrow: request / action   |   Dashed arrow: returned result
  Activation ends before waiting for Student input. Read guards top to bottom.
  critical: required consistency boundary; updates are all-or-none as noted
endlegend
footer Smart E-Mobility Hub | Submission 2 | Parking & Private EVs
@enduml
